# Vercel serves /api/* and nothing else - its root is a 404, and the dashboard
# is hosted by GitHub Pages. So the deployment needs api/ and vercel.json, and
# uploading the rest only slows the build and enlarges what is stored.
#
# The journal matters most here. It is committed every ten minutes during a
# session, and it is not read from the bundle at all: api/journal.py fetches it
# live from the GitHub contents API, which is what makes the dashboard current
# rather than as-of-last-deploy.
agent/
dashboard/
docs/
journal/
scripts/
tests/
design/
site/
.github/
.venv/
*.pptx
*.db
